TREPAT Tracking Guideline — SOURCE OF TRUTH
============================================
(Engine: scripts/trepat_track.py — every announcement type below maps 1:1 to it.
Rules at the bottom override wording. Names only — never Nifty price / level values.)

Session Open
============
    Session open. Gap up/down +/-x.xx% from previous close.
    Resistance within 50 pts above: <level names>
    Support within 50 pts below: <level names>
    (VOC announcements unavailable when export has no volume)


