        // DPM = Daily PVT/MACD2. DPM uptrending -> 30m EMA50/100/200 act as
        // SUPPORT; DPM downtrending -> they act as RESISTANCE.
        // D WAP (Daily VWAP) has nothing to do with DPM.
    5m Stochastic cross down from OBZ/MZ/OSZ
        Expect 1PXD_15PM Swing Downs
